Se crea U1 = (-1, -1, -1)
Se intenta crear U2 = (-2, 1, 1)
Se crea U3 = (2, 1, 1)

   Constructor por copia

       ubicacio U4 = ubicacio(U1)
       Filera: -1 Plaça: -1 Pis: -1

   Asignación

       U4 = U3
       Filera: 2 Plaça: 1 Pis: 1

   Operador ==

       U4 = (2, 1, 1)
       U4 == U3: 1
       U4 == U1: 0

   Operacdor !=

       U4 = (2, 1, 1)
       U4 != U3: 0
       U4 != U1: 1

   Operador <

       U4 = (2, 1, 1)
       U1 = (2, 0, 0)
       U1 < U4: 1
       U1 = (2, 1, 0)
       U1 < U4: 1
       U1 = (2, 1, 1)
       U1 < U4: 0
       U1 = (2, 0, 1)
       U1 < U4: 1
       U1 = (2, 3, 1)
       U1 < U4: 0

   Operador <=

       U4 = (2, 1, 1)
       U1 = (1, 1, 1)
       U1 <= U4: 1
       U1 = (0, 1, 1)
       U1 <= U4: 1
       U1 = (2, 3, 0)
       U1 <= U4: 1

   Operador >

       U4 = (2, 1, 1)
       U1 = (2, 0, 0)
       U1 > U4: 0
